<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND V MATABELELAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V MATABELELAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>first day of the four-day match between England and Matabeleland</p>
<p>on Tuesday:</p>
<p>England first innings</p>
<p> N.Knight not out			  100</p>
<p> M.Atherton b Olonga			 4</p>
<p> A.Stewart c G.Whittall b Streak	39</p>
<p> N.Hussain c James b Olonga	     38</p>
<p> G.Thorpe not out			    5</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-4 w-1 nb-7)	     13</p>
<p>Total (for three wickets, 54 overs) 199</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-14 2-100 3-185</p>
<p>To bat: J.Crawley, R.Irani, R.Croft, D.Gough, A.Caddick,</p>
<p>P.Tufnell</p>
<p>Bowling: Olonga 10-2-42-2, Streak 10-1-39-1 (nb4),</p>
<p>G.Whittall 8-3-16-0, Mbwanga 13-2-46-0 (nb3), Rennie 4-0-17-0</p>
<p>(w1), Vaghmaria 3-0-9-0, A.Whittall 6-1-25-0 (nb1)</p>
<p>Matabeleland: J.Rennie (captain), G.Whittall, M.Dekker,</p>
<p>H.Streak, W.James, M.Abrams, M.Ranchod, D.Vaghmaria, H.Olonga,</p>
<p>M.Mbangwa, A.Whittall</p>
